==Drops==
The first player to successfully open the chest will receive either a trinket, a weapon, or a piece of the [[Ancient Warriors' equipment|Ancient Warriors' armour]].{{CiteNews|url=https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/deadman-annihilation---everything-you-need-to-know?oldschool=1|title=Deadman: Annihilation - Everything You Need To Know|newsdate=23 January 2026|quote=The first player to open the chest will receive a guaranteed drop of any of the following: Trinket of Advanced Weaponry, Trinket of Undead, Morrigan's Thrownaxe x100, Morrigan's Javelin x100, Any piece of Ancient Warrior's armour (Vesta, Statius, Morrigan or Zuriel)... The Thunder Khopesh... The Dogsword}}

On the permanent Deadman world, the chest will contain a tier 5 [[archaic emblem]], with a rare chance to instead drop Ancient Warrior's armour and a very rare chance to instead drop the dogsword.

