*Its appearance and animations are the same as that of the [[Deadman Supply Chest]].
*It is possible for [[breach monster]]s to spawn a Deadman's chest.
*Every one of the timed chest spawn broadcast messages is grammatically incorrect, e.g., {{mes|A Deadman's Chest has spawned at on the Catherby Beach!}}{{sic}}

